{"title": "Tides of Chaos (Condition)", "pageid": 27371, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Tides_of_Chaos_(Condition)", "categories": ["Has status groups", "Bugs", "Conditions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">  \n</p>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\"> \n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ca/Tides_of_Chaos_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Tides_of_Chaos_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/ca/Tides_of_Chaos_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Tides_of_Chaos_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/ca/Tides_of_Chaos_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Tides_of_Chaos_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Tides of Chaos Condition Icon.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/ca/Tides_of_Chaos_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Tides_of_Chaos_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/ca/Tides_of_Chaos_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <b>Tides of Chaos</b>\n</p>\n</div>\n<ul><li>Increased chance of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wild_Magic_(passive_feature)\" title=\"Wild Magic (passive feature)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2a/Wild_Magic_passive_feature_Icon.webp/25px-Wild_Magic_passive_feature_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2a/Wild_Magic_passive_feature_Icon.webp/38px-Wild_Magic_passive_feature_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2a/Wild_Magic_passive_feature_Icon.webp/50px-Wild_Magic_passive_feature_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Wild Magic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2a/Wild_Magic_passive_feature_Icon.webp/25px-Wild_Magic_passive_feature_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2a/Wild_Magic_passive_feature_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wild_Magic_(passive_feature)\" title=\"Wild Magic (passive feature)\">Wild Magic</a> surge (to 50%).</li>\n<li>Lost immediately after casting a Level 1 or higher Spell and rolling a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wild_Magic_(passive_feature)\" title=\"Wild Magic (passive feature)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2a/Wild_Magic_passive_feature_Icon.webp/25px-Wild_Magic_passive_feature_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2a/Wild_Magic_passive_feature_Icon.webp/38px-Wild_Magic_passive_feature_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2a/Wild_Magic_passive_feature_Icon.webp/50px-Wild_Magic_passive_feature_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Wild Magic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2a/Wild_Magic_passive_feature_Icon.webp/25px-Wild_Magic_passive_feature_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2a/Wild_Magic_passive_feature_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wild_Magic_(passive_feature)\" title=\"Wild Magic (passive feature)\">Wild Magic</a> Check. </li></ul>\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-condition-type\"></span>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\">Properties</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\">\n<p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" title=\"Stack ID\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Stack ID\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b2/Info_Icon.png/25px-Info_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b2/Info_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Stack_ID\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stack ID\">Stack ID</a>: <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">TIDES_OF_CHAOS_TECHNICAL</code> <span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CTIDES_OF_CHAOS_TECHNICAL%22+type:status\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=%22data%2CStackId%2CTIDES_OF_CHAOS_TECHNICAL%22+type:status\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span>\n</p>\n<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Status_groups\" title=\"Status groups\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png/25px-Plus_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png/38px-Plus_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Status groups\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png/25px-Plus_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4b/Plus_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Status_groups\" title=\"Status groups\">Status groups</a>: <a href=\"/wiki/SG_RemoveOnRespec\" title=\"SG RemoveOnRespec\">SG_RemoveOnRespec</a></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\">Bugs</span></h2>\n<ul><li>When applied via <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Tides_of_Chaos_(passive_feature)\" title=\"Tides of Chaos (passive feature)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8d/Tides_of_Chaos_Icon.webp/20px-Tides_of_Chaos_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8d/Tides_of_Chaos_Icon.webp/30px-Tides_of_Chaos_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8d/Tides_of_Chaos_Icon.webp/40px-Tides_of_Chaos_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Tides of Chaos\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8d/Tides_of_Chaos_Icon.webp/20px-Tides_of_Chaos_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8d/Tides_of_Chaos_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Tides_of_Chaos_(passive_feature)\" title=\"Tides of Chaos (passive feature)\">Tides of Chaos</a>, this condition is <i>not</i> removed on Long Rest despite the tooltip. This condition is correctly removed on Long Rest when applied via the Tides of Chaos reaction.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sources_of_Tides_of_Chaos\">Sources of Tides of Chaos</span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition-sources\"><ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Tides_of_Chaos_(passive_feature)\" title=\"Tides of Chaos (passive feature)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8d/Tides_of_Chaos_Icon.webp/30px-Tides_of_Chaos_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8d/Tides_of_Chaos_Icon.webp/45px-Tides_of_Chaos_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8d/Tides_of_Chaos_Icon.webp/60px-Tides_of_Chaos_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Tides of Chaos\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8d/Tides_of_Chaos_Icon.webp/30px-Tides_of_Chaos_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8d/Tides_of_Chaos_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Tides_of_Chaos_(passive_feature)\" title=\"Tides of Chaos (passive feature)\">Tides of Chaos</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 5px\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\" style=\"